# Impeccable (project skill, docs/design/IMPECCABLE_SETUP.md): keep its data files (the
# generic `data/` rule above would drop them), not its 21 MB engine binary, which the
# launcher downloads and checks against scripts/engine-checksums.txt on first run
!.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/data/
.claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/
.impeccable/
